[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2889248511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102973#issuecomment-2889248511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102973","id":2889248511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sNm7_","user":{"login":"ytianle","id":61530469,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTMwNDY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61530469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle","html_url":"https://github.com/ytianle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T22:33:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T22:33:46Z","body":"Hi Team, I am interested in digging into this bug and try to fix it. Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2889248511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892013478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102973#issuecomment-2892013478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102973","id":2892013478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sYJ-m","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T19:06:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T19:08:34Z","body":"It looks like SoftBody normal computation always results in smooth shading, which is fine for meshes that are expected to be curved, but it falls apart for meshes with sharp edges. It might be possible to perform angle calculations to force normals to be sharp in situations that need it, but this check is probably expensive with complex meshes.\n\nOne way to work around this issue is to design your geometry with smooth shading in mind. Create additional edge loops in Blender and (optionally) make the box's edges slightly rounded in the process. The Bevel modifier can help with this.\n\n> The SoftBody3D normals are correct in the editor:\n\nThe physics server is inactive in the editor, so that's expected there.\n\n> Hi Team, I am interested in digging into this bug and try to fix it. Thanks!\n\nFor future reference, we only use the assignees feature for core contributors (and we don't always use it in the first place). Since contributors can leave at any time for any reason, we'd rather avoid a situation where nobody is working on an issue because it's assigned to someone who is no longer active.\n\nIn practice, this means you can look into fixing this right away 🙂 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892013478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892023446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102973#issuecomment-2892023446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102973","id":2892023446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sYMaW","user":{"login":"ytianle","id":61530469,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTMwNDY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61530469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle","html_url":"https://github.com/ytianle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ytianle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T19:11:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T19:11:33Z","body":"@Calinou Could you please explain \"we only use the assignees feature for core contributors (and we don't always use it in the first place)\"? I don't quite understand","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://a